1
00:00:06,016 --> 00:00:07,286
(Leonard:)All right, here's the deal.

2
00:00:07,451 --> 00:00:10,761
(Leonard:)Sheldon is gone, so the tree
decorating rules are out the window.

3
00:00:10,921 --> 00:00:12,761
(Penny:)Yeah, which means
we don't have to use

4
00:00:12,856 --> 00:00:15,806
(Penny:)his ridiculous
ornament-spacing template.

5
00:00:16,793 --> 00:00:18,833
(Leonard:)And I'm happy to report
its Kickstarter campaign

6
00:00:18,962 --> 00:00:20,672
(Leonard:)is holding strong at zero dollars.

7
00:00:21,832 --> 00:00:24,042
(Raj:)Wait, so Star Wars
and Star Trek characters

8
00:00:24,201 --> 00:00:25,701
(Raj:)can go on the same branch?

9
00:00:26,303 --> 00:00:27,473
(Leonard:)I know, it's crazy.

10
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:29,484
Welcome to the Thunderdome, people!

11
00:00:29,606 --> 00:00:30,776
Woo!

12
00:00:31,441 --> 00:00:33,681
(Howard:)I've never done this before.
It's kind of fun.

13
00:00:34,144 --> 00:00:36,354
(Raj:)Yeah, if your mom could see
her little Bar Mitzvah boy right now,

14
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,480
(Raj:)she'd have a heart attack.

15
00:00:37,614 --> 00:00:39,524
(Bernadette:)Good idea, I'll take a picture.

16
00:00:44,187 --> 00:00:45,897
(Penny:)Honey, I'm a little strapped
for cash this year,

17
00:00:46,056 --> 00:00:48,666
(Penny:)so for Christmas I was
thinking of giving you...

18
00:00:49,393 --> 00:00:50,393
(Penny:)...this.

19
00:00:52,229 --> 00:00:53,469
(Leonard:)I love it.

20
00:00:53,563 --> 00:00:54,803
(Penny:)Okay.

21
00:00:54,898 --> 00:00:56,738
(Leonard:)But it is what you got me last year.

22
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,900
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-And last night.

23
00:00:59,903 --> 00:01:02,403
(Stuart:)Hello.

